<?xml version="1.0" ?>
<!--
  GENERATED by tools/gen_lunar_arena.py - edit that and re-run, do not hand-edit.

  Caterpillar Autonomy Challenge arena, 9 m x 5 m.
    x 0.0 .. 2.0   Starting Zone (y 3.0..5.0), Construction Zone (y 0.0..1.5)
    x 2.0 .. 7.5   Obstacle Zone
    x 7.5 .. 9.0   Excavation Zone
  Layout seed 2027. Rock and crater positions are randomised between
  competition runs, so re-run with LAYOUT_SEED set to something else and make
  sure the autonomy still works. Tuning against one layout proves nothing.
-->
